WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.340
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.330
I'd tear you apart!

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.450
If I eliminate this bamboo...!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.620
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:12.540
Right here...

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:22.050
CHAPTER 63

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:27.000
THE STAR FESTIVAL OF LOVE
THE YOKAI FLOWER

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:30.900
SEEKING GIRLFRIEND

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.000
Please!

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:36.510
Natsumi-chan or Yuka-chan or
even Maki-chan!

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:33.900
I WANT A GIRLFRIEND!

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:36.400
I WANT TO GO ON A DATE

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:39.010
Somebody go on a date with me!

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:41.280
What you doing?

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:42.660
What else?!

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:47.020
Today's the Star Festival.
I'm tyin' my wishes to bamboo.

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:52.670
A blockhead like you'd never understand
such refined things, Wally Wall.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:57.440
For such "refined things," your wishes
seem pretty lecherous.

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.300
Catchick...

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:04.030
Well sure, you've got Kitaro so--

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:07.680
Sorry.

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:12.290
This is from... Rat Man?

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:12.190
TO KITARO-CHAN

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:16.440
"Help. A bad <i>yokai</i> is attacking humans.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:19.550
There's been multiple victims."

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:22.200
What terrible handwriting.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.160
This is all bamboo?

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.310
And it's blooming.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:33.060
Don't bamboo flowers bloom only once
every few decades?

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.960
This stuff must be blessed!

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:39.840
If I hang a wish here,
I'm sure to become a real ladies' man!

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:43.820
Hey, where's Wally Wall?
I thought he was with us.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:48.350
Huh? Did he get lost?
He's always so slow.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:05.780
What's wrong? Tears don't suit
a pretty young girl like ya.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:06.890
Tear...

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:09.240
I thought...

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:10.520
What?

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.460
...I'd tear you apart!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.790
Whoa!

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.150
Who are you?!

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:22.340
You're with that Rat Man guy, aren't you?

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:25.510
If you want to live then leave this place!

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:32.750
Who was that?

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.760
What me do?

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:47.740
Are you with those others?

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:49.910
Just leave and...

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:53.390
Are you hurt?

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:02.590
This is medicine made from
bamboo flower nectar.

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:07.180
Rub that on and get out of here.

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:14.520
Thank you.

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:25.550
Rat Man!

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:28.300
Ah, my friend, you're here!

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:32.010
You're not up to no good again are you?

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:35.500
Come on. Is that the first thing you say?

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:40.750
Wally Wall, where were you?
We were worried.

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.650
Me sorry.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:44.010
Well?

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:45.510
Can't you see?

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:49.260
I'm thinking of
starting a new business here.

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:51.350
In a remote place like this?

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:53.930
Th-That's the problem with amateurs!

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:57.160
Being remote has its own
business opportunities.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:58.790
Huh...

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:04.050
Again?!

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:06.030
Hey, are you okay?

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.110
Yes, sir.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:10.120
This is from earlier...

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.680
Did you guys run into that girl?

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:16.180
We met a <i>yokai</i> who controls bamboo.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:18.420
That makes things easier.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:22.460
That's our problem <i>yokai</i>.
Her name's Seika.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.670
She's a spirit of the bamboo in this area.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:29.640
She's been attacking humans
indiscriminately since long ago.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.470
-Right?
-Y-Yes...

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:35.220
The people around here
always live in fear of Seika.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:41.730
So she's not just mad because you're
wrecking her home?

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.730
Hey, give me some credit.

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.240
You heard what he said, right?

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:51.030
In that case, we'll help ya out.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:55.580
We can't ignore someone who just attacks
without warnin'.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:58.230
Good. We're in agreement then.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:03.000
As thanks, I've booked a room in
a nearby village inn.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:05.630
Rest there and prepare for tomorrow.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:08.300
That's unusually considerate of you.

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:15.060
What's wrong, Wally Wall?

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:18.330
Wally Wall go later.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.600
What, you're still here?

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:41.350
If you're here to cut the bamboo
with Rat Man, I won't show any mercy!

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:45.230
This bamboo so important?

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.750
Of course!

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:50.630
This bamboo forest contains
the wishes of many people.

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.110
Wishes?

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:53.640
That's right.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:08:00.850
For centuries, this forest is where
people brought their Star Festival wishes.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:05.670
People can be cruel at times...

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:10.670
but their compassion is so warm.

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.570
-PLEASE CURE MOM
-FAMILY HAPPINESS

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:17.910
Recently, people have left
the local villages...

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.290
and this forest is being forgotten.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:27.630
Even so, the wishes of
those kind people remain,

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:30.210
and are alive in this place.

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:33.090
They are precious things.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:37.010
As precious as the animals that live here.

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:41.430
I want to protect them.

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:42.730
That's why...

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:48.040
Then why do mean thing to humans?

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:51.050
I had to in order to protect the bamboo.

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:54.280
But I don't intend to hurt anyone.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:09:01.060
Seika-san only threaten
Rat Man and humans he with?

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.560
That's right.

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:08.170
<i>She's a spirit of the bamboo in this area.</i>

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:12.460
<i>She's been attacking humans
indiscriminately since long ago.</i>

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:20.450
I can only exist for a short time in the
summer while the bamboo flowers bloom.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:24.960
So I need to hurry and drive
Rat Man and the others out.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:29.900
Me think me understand Seika-san a bit.

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:32.320
But me want to know more.

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:36.450
Huh? How come? You're an enemy.

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.410
Oof!

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:45.790
What Seika-san wish for?

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:49.690
Isn't it obvious?
To protect this bamboo forest.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:54.190
That make Seika-san happy?

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:57.220
I... don't know.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:01.080
I'm always looking after
other people's wishes.

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:05.080
I've never even considered my own.

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:11.920
That Seika-san find her wish.

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:15.920
That Wally Wall's wish this year.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:20.910
You're a strange one.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.400
Right here...

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:38.400
What do you think, Dad?

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:44.430
Hmm. Knowing Rat Man,
he's probably up to something, but...

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:54.150
Ah, Kitaro!

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:55.710
Help me...

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:57.900
We saw you this afternoon!

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:05.720
Wally Wall.

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:07.040
Wally Wall!

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.660
Thanks.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:14.480
What happened to you?

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:16.510
I-I was...

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:22.110
H-Her! She did this to me!

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.350
Huh?!

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:28.270
Seika-san?

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:31.620
Dammit! How dare you
attack an innocent human!

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:34.360
I didn't! I heard the scream and...

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:36.130
Stop lying!

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:39.970
We've got it from the victim's mouth!
You can't deny it!

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:47.330
Wally Wall, what are ya doin?!

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:51.690
Wally Wall believe Seika-san.

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:55.440
Wally Wall...

00:11:56.420 --> 00:12:00.070
Seika-san not do that.

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:03.010
Wally Wall know.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:05.700
Why do you defend me?!

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:09.080
You barely even know me!

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:10.950
Even so...

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:15.940
Seika-san!

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:25.820
Did she really do this to you?

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:28.180
W-Well, um...

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.560
What's wrong?

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.160
Uh...

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:37.170
<i>Crap. It's only a matter of time...</i>

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:46.970
Hey! Any progress?!

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.080
Who?

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:51.850
Rat Man? Or not I guess.

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:55.580
Doesn't matter.
You've got to move this boulder!

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:58.020
Please!

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:02.190
I got drunk and when I woke up
I was trapped in here!

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:04.610
I didn't do anything wrong!

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:12.180
Got it. You wait a minute.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:17.980
Wally Wall!

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:29.910
Thanks for breaking that seal!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.540
ASHI-MAGARI

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:49.680
WALLY WALL

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:54.180
WALLY WALL

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.080
-<i>"Oh no..."</i>
-<i>"I'll turn this into money."</i>

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.080
<i>"Smack!"</i>

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:03.710
Ooh! A lucky break!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:07.240
Rat Man? What going on?

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:10.600
Well, it's a long story,

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:15.950
but I was running from loan sharks and
walking through this bamboo forest when...

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:21.270
They won't follow me this far.

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:23.400
Hey you.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:27.320
Sounds like you're in trouble.
Money related?

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.620
That's right. Everything's about money.

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:33.470
If I had money
everything'd be great, but...

00:14:33.490 --> 00:14:36.480
Want to know where buried gold is?

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:38.960
B-Buried gold?! Of course!

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:41.920
Then move this boulder.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:47.340
But that stupid Seika kept interfering.

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:52.100
So I bought off some humans
to make her look like the bad guy.

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:55.290
Then... Wally Wall...

00:14:55.310 --> 00:15:00.770
So, Ashi-Magari-sensei,
where's this buried gold?

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.020
There is none.

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:04.880
What?! But...!

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:10.630
I was sealed away by Seika
when I was attacking the humans.

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:13.140
Now it's time for my revenge.

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:17.770
She's just a bamboo spirit.

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:21.020
If I eliminate this bamboo...!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.460
H-How cruel.

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:34.300
This Wally Wall's fault!

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:40.410
This feeling...

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:43.170
Hey, this is just a pitfall trap.

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:46.400
Did you try to trick us?

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:49.990
So Wally Wall was right.

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:52.430
Rat Man's behind this.

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:57.930
Yo, Seika! Long time no see!

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:02.810
I've been waiting for this day
ever since you sealed me away!

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.020
Ashi-Magari...

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:10.990
You?!

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:15.990
Me sorry. Me tricked into breaking seal!

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.830
Ashi-Magari, stop it!

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:22.690
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:30.590
We have to get him away from here
or the bamboo will...!

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:34.430
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:43.040
Hop on!

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.630
Me sorry, Seika-san.

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:57.910
Seika-san always listen to others' wishes.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:04.920
Me wanted to help Seika-san
find her own wish.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:09.320
Can Wally Wall stay with Seika-san?

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:12.690
Until Seika-san find her wish.

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:14.680
Suit yourself.

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:21.930
You think luring me away means
the bamboo forest is safe?

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:23.180
Chumps.

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:28.980
What?!

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:42.270
Not going to fight back?! In that case...

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:48.980
Kitaro!

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:53.630
My cloud's a bit of a glutton!
It'll eat anything!

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:57.130
Those consumed become part of the cloud.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.660
How...?!

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:09.020
Stop! Any more and you'll die!

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:13.280
Wally Wall protect Seika-san!

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:17.660
If we can just get that drum...

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:19.260
Rollo Cloth, let's do it!

00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:20.780
Cotton copies!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.790
Give it up!

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.560
Wally Wall, that's enough!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:31.110
Forget about me! You'll die!

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:33.090
Me no care!

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.800
Wally Wall!

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:40.910
Seika-san going to find her own wish
and make come true!

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:49.210
A-whoop! Here goes!

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:53.050
Ya bastard!

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:56.570
How dare you!

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:02.830
Give back Kitaro!

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:07.910
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:15.780
Kitaro, are you okay?

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:18.380
Give me back my drum!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:29.620
Finger Guns!

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:49.750
Seika-san?

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.440
Hey, Wally Wall.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:01.950
I've already found my wish.

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:05.890
I want to hold hands with you
like this again.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:10.710
That's my first and last wish.

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:34.770
Where's Seika?

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:39.110
Seika-san... go home.

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:42.450
That's...! Look at that!

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:48.510
Seika-san!

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:53.000
Seika-san!

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:57.520
Let's take good care of that.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:02.130
